    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>From the creator of Inscryption... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pony Island 2: Panda Circus</strong> is a phantasmagorical voyage through time, myth, divinity, and video games. You were a young nomad who would have gone on to conquer the world\u2026 until an early death doomed you to The Earth Prison. Now you must escape the lordly deities of the underworld with your soul, and your sanity, intact. This is not a game about ponies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In Pony Island 2: Panda Circus you will...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Bargain for your soul with the eccentric deities who reign over The Earth Prison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Beat (or break) their games with naught but your steed, your thumb drive, and your wits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Become your destiny, or attempt to transcend it</p></li></ul>",
